.TH ckman-fido-access-set-pin 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-access\-set\-pin \- Set the FIDO2 PIN (when none is set)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-access\-set\-pin\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-new\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the FIDO2 PIN (when none is set)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-new\-pin\fR \fI<NEW_PIN>\fR
New PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
